=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists i:A\\to\\omega\\;\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(i(a)=i(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists i:A\\to\\omega\\;\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(i(a)=i(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3